D={
156:(["8 人局（暗流涌动）：5 镇民、1 外来者、1 爪牙、1 恶魔，说书人发好角色。","首夜：爪牙和恶魔互相确认（≥7 人），恶魔得知 3 个不在场角色；洗衣妇得知“3 号或 6 号之一是共情者”。","第一天：4 号提名 7 号，5 人举手（8 人存活，≥4 票），7 号上处决台；没人得票更多，7 号被处决，他其实是镇民。","第二夜：小恶魔杀了 2 号；共情者得知身边有 1 个邪恶玩家。","第三天：大家交叉信息锁定 5 号，死去的 7 号用掉幽灵票帮忙投票，5 号是小恶魔被处决，好人获胜。"],
 ["8 players (Trouble Brewing): 5 Townsfolk, 1 Outsider, 1 Minion, 1 Demon.","First night: Minion and Demon meet (7+ players) and the Demon gets 3 bluffs; the Washerwoman learns one of seats 3 or 6 is the Empath.","Day 1: seat 4 nominates seat 7; 5 hands (8 alive, 4 needed); seat 7 is executed — a Townsfolk.","Night 2: the Imp kills seat 2; the Empath learns one evil neighbour.","Day 3: cross-checked info points at seat 5; dead seat 7 spends the ghost vote; seat 5 is the Imp and is executed — good wins."],
 "没有分数：恶魔死亡好人胜；只剩 2 人且恶魔存活邪恶胜；另有圣徒被处决、镇长存活到最后 3 人等特殊胜负。","No points: good wins when the Demon dies; evil wins with 2 alive and the Demon alive; special conditions like the Saint or Mayor apply.",
 [("死了还能投票吗？","能，但整局只有 1 张幽灵票，用掉就没了；死者不能提名。","Can the dead vote?","Yes, once per game with their ghost vote; they cannot nominate."),
  ("平票怎么办？","两人票数相同则当天都不处决。","What about a tie?","A tie means no execution that day."),
  ("说书人可以给假信息吗？","可以，但只限中毒、醉酒等规则允许的情况。","Can the Storyteller lie?","Only when rules allow, e.g. to poisoned or drunk players.")],
 "5–6 人用小型剧本更合适；7 人起爪牙和恶魔互认；10 人以上 2–3 个爪牙，最热闹的是 8–12 人。","5–6 players suit small scripts; Minions and Demon meet from 7 players; 10+ players add Minions; 8–12 is the sweet spot.",
 "官方三本大型剧本（暗流涌动、黯月初升、梦殒春宵）、小型剧本与旅行者；还有大量社区自制剧本。","Three base scripts (Trouble Brewing, Bad Moon Rising, Sects & Violets), teensy scripts, Travellers and many community scripts."),
157:(["7 人局，每人 3 张牌；阿明手里有 1 张红牌，所以他是刀刃方。","夜里白蔷薇和司教睁眼，双刃把幽魂和中央的双刃换了。","第 1 轮：金币传给小李结算白水晶；大家依次暗出牌，共 4 张。","洗混翻开：3 张白牌 + 1 张幽魂，没有刃，3 张白牌进献祭区。","第 3 轮白蔷薇出手时翻出一把巨刃——白蔷薇和刃一起翻开，刀刃方立即获胜。"],
 ["7 players, 3 cards each; Ming holds one red card, so he is a Blade.","Night: the White Rose and Bishop wake; the Twin Blade swaps the Ghost with the centre Twin Blade.","Round 1: the coin goes to Li, who resolves a crystal; 4 cards are played face down.","Revealed: 3 white + 1 Ghost, no blade — 3 white cards go to sacrifice.","Round 3: the White Rose comes out alongside a Great Blade — Blades win instantly."],
 "门槛制：献祭数在最后一轮前达到版图门槛白方胜；击杀数达到门槛或拖到最后刀刃方胜。","Threshold-based: White needs the sacrifice threshold before the last round; Blades need the kill threshold or to survive to the end.",
 [("手里两白一红算哪边？","刀刃方，有任意红牌就是刀刃。","Two white and one red?","Blade — any red card makes you a Blade."),
  ("幽魂会触发击杀吗？","不会，翻开后直接弃掉。","Does the Ghost cause kills?","No, it is discarded when revealed.")],
 "5–10 人都能玩；人数不同使用不同版图和门槛，7–9 人最有推理味。","5–10 players with a board per count; 7–9 is best.",
 "有 2.0 版本，部分角色与技能卡调整，以盒内为准。","A 2.0 edition adjusts some roles and spell cards."),
158:None,
159:(["4 人局，选剧本卡后从三块起始板块出发。","小王走进新门翻出“图书馆”，抽到物品，回合立即结束。","第 3 张预兆出现，掷 3 颗骰得 2+2+1=5，鬼魂触发。","按剧本卡查到鬼魂编号，揭示者左手边的人成为叛徒，大家先公开朗读开场。","英雄完成《幸存秘籍》里的仪式，赢下本局。"],
 ["4 players start on the three starting tiles after choosing a Scenario card.","Wang opens a door, reveals the Library, draws an item — turn over.","Third omen: roll 3 dice for 2+2+1=5 — the haunt starts.","The Scenario card gives the haunt and the traitor; everyone reads the intro aloud.","The heroes complete the ritual from Secrets of Survival and win."],
 "没有分数：完成鬼魂目标的一方获胜。","No points: whoever completes their haunt goal wins.",
 [("第三版鬼魂检定怎么掷？","每出一张预兆，掷与已出预兆数相同的骰子，总和 ≥5 触发。","How is the haunt roll done?","Roll dice equal to omens revealed; 5+ starts the haunt."),
  ("鬼魂出现前会死吗？","不会，属性降不到骷髅格。","Can you die before the haunt?","No."),
  ("能和第二版混用吗？","剧本书与规则不同，不建议混用。","Mix with 2nd edition?","Not recommended; rules and haunt books differ.")],
 "3–6 人；4–5 人最好，3 人局英雄方压力较大。","3–6 players; 4–5 is best.",
 "扩展《狼人之旅：血月》（5 个新鬼魂、新角色等）。","Expansion: The Werewolf's Journey: Blood on the Moon."),
160:(["2 人局，每人操控 1 名英雄、每轮行动 2 次：碎铁者和光明巫师。","第一张地点生成 2 个敌人，碎铁者攻击掷出 3 个成功，消灭一只哥布林。","巫师探索掷出 2 个成功，在地点放 2 个进度；交战的敌人掷黑骰造成 1 伤。","地点探索完，队伍前往下一地点，弃掉阴影区普通敌人。","最终地点击败宿敌，任务完成。"],
 ["2 players, one hero each acting twice per round: Ironbreaker and Bright Wizard.","The first location spawns 2 enemies; the Ironbreaker rolls 3 successes and kills a goblin.","The Wizard explores for 2 progress; an engaged enemy's black die deals 1 damage.","Fully explored — travel on, discarding normal enemies in the shadows.","Defeat the nemesis at the final location: quest complete."],
 "没有分数：完成任务目标即胜利；战役中累计升级。","No points: complete the quest objective; progress carries over in a campaign.",
 [("行动卡用完怎么办？","每个英雄有一张行动会重置全部行动卡。","All actions exhausted?","Each hero has one action that readies all cards."),
  ("暴击怎么算？","算 1 个成功并再掷一次，可以连爆。","How do criticals work?","Count a success and roll again, can chain.")],
 "1–4 人；单人通常操控 2 名英雄；4 人局职业搭配最丰富。","1–4; solo runs 2 heroes; 4 players gives the best synergy.",
 "有额外英雄包（如猎巫人、屠魔者）和战役 / 随机地城模式。","Hero packs (e.g. Witch Hunter, Troll Slayer) and delve mode."),
161:None,
162:(["2 人局，选第一个剧本，摆好面朝下的地图。","刷怪：掷出 7，所有数字 7 的已翻开板块刷怪。","消防员 4 个行动：移动、移动（翻开新板块）、出一把斧头、拾荒拿到食物。","外科医生出治疗牌救队友，再用角色专属行动。","回合结束交战怪物攻击；第 5 轮凑齐物资完成剧本，全员胜利。"],
 ["2 players, scenario 1, map face down.","Spawn: a 7 is rolled; every revealed 7 tile spawns.","Firefighter: move, move (reveal), equip an axe, scavenge food.","Surgeon heals a teammate and uses her special action.","Monsters attack; in round 5 the supplies are collected — victory."],
 "没有分数：完成剧本目标胜利，有人死亡（含牌库抽空）则失败。","No points: complete the scenario; a death (including empty deck) loses.",
 [("牌库抽空会怎样？","角色死亡，通常导致失败。","Empty deck?","The character dies, usually losing the game."),
  ("潜行检定怎么算？","潜行值 − 两颗骰点数和 ≥ 怪物标记数就成功。","Stealth check?","Stealth minus 2d6 must reach the number of monster tokens.")],
 "人数见盒面；人少时每个角色压力更大。","Player count per the box.",
 "基础盒有十多个剧本和 4 套怪物牌组，可自由组合。","A dozen-plus scenarios and 4 monster decks."),
163:None,
164:(["3 人局，目标选第一部电影。","小林打出 3 张专员得 3 攻击 2 招募，扫描综合体最外侧的牌：一只工蜂。","她招募一张 2 费的新牌，空位补上。","巢穴阶段新牌进入，工蜂被推进战斗区，攻击阶段对她造成 2 伤。","下一位玩家消灭工蜂，三人逐步完成三个目标。"],
 ["3 players, first-film objectives.","Lin plays 3 Specialists for 3 Attack and 2 Recruit and scans the outer card: a Drone.","She recruits a 2-cost card; HQ refills.","Hive phase pushes the Drone into the Combat Zone; Strike deals 2 damage.","The next player kills it; the team works through all three objectives."],
 "没有分数：完成三个目标即全员胜利。","No points: complete three objectives together.",
 [("抱脸虫多久破胸？","2 个回合后。","When does a facehugger burst?","After 2 turns."),
  ("有人死了怎么办？","基础规则全队失败；玩家异形变体中会变成异形。","Someone dies?","Base: everyone loses; Player Aliens variant: they become an alien.")],
 "1–5 人；2–4 人最佳，5 人等待时间较长。","1–5; best at 2–4.",
 "玩家异形、隐藏议程变体；另有《异形》系列扩展。","Player Aliens and Hidden Agenda variants; expansions."),
165:None,
166:(["3 人局，小张掷 7 颗骰子，选择攻打德川家的江户城。","第一次掷出 2 个骑兵，完成骑兵行。","用剩下 5 颗再掷，没能完成任何一行，丢掉 1 颗骰子。","剩 4 颗重掷，凑出 3+2 步兵完成步兵行，拿下江户城。","后来她集齐德川三城，叠起来改按家族分计分，别人再也抢不走。"],
 ["3 players: Zhang rolls 7 dice and attacks Edo (Tokugawa).","First roll: 2 cavalry fill the cavalry line.","Rerolling 5 dice completes nothing — set one die aside.","With 4 dice she rolls 3+2 infantry, completing the line and taking Edo.","Later she unites all three Tokugawa castles, scoring the clan value; they cannot be stolen."],
 "城堡分相加，统一的家族改按更高的家族分；总分最高获胜。","Sum castle values, or the higher clan value for united clans; highest wins.",
 [("步兵行怎么凑？","看步兵总数，可以用多颗骰子相加。","How do infantry lines work?","Total infantry; several dice can combine."),
  ("能换攻打目标吗？","不能，一回合只攻打选定的那座城。","Can I switch targets?","No, one castle per turn.")],
 "2–6 人；3–4 人节奏最好，人多时抢城更频繁。","2–6; 3–4 is ideal; more players means more stealing.",
 "无官方扩展；可以约定“抢城不需大名行”的简化家规给小朋友玩。","No expansions; kids can drop the daimyo line for stealing as a house rule."),
}
